OL,3,GNEWSAMore Sinn Fein politicians attend
OL,4,Apolice interview over Garvaghy Road
OL,5,Aprotest
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore senior Sinn Fein politicians have
OL,8,Fattended police interviews over their
OL,9,Froles in a protest on the Garvaghy Road
OL,10,Fthat blocked an Orange Order parade
OL,11,Flast month.
OL,13,FAssembly members (MLA) Deirdre Hargey
OL,14,Fand Gerry Kelly and member of Seanad
OL,15,FEireann (the upper house of the Irish
OL,16,Fparliament) attended Musgrave Police
OL,17,FStation in Belfast on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
