OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMore Sinn Fein politicians attend
OL,4,Apolice interview over Garvaghy Road
OL,5,Aprotest
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after the First Minister
OL,8,FMichelle O'Neill and Sinn Fein
OL,9,FPresident Mary Lou McDonald also
OL,10,Fattended police interviews earlier this
OL,11,Fweek.
OL,13,FThe protests were part of a 13-day
OL,14,Fstand-off which blocked a contentious
OL,15,FOrange Order march from passing along
OL,16,Fthe mainly nationalist street.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
